		(uuid "36270884-09c4-5ea8-9575-e5438eb9e001")
	)
	(text "Current limit set by R1604 49.9k: 470-588 mA calculated. EN on SERVICE_POWER_EN (PE8), held low by R1602\nat reset and power-off: a bounded, sequenced restart separate from comms. Native connectivity is preserved; no first-PCBA fault test has been performed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 185.42 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "383e3cdc-b8ff-5563-8079-7739a94b8393")
	)
	(text "What this does: Limits current into optional peripherals, which must not be required for flight to continue.\nConnects to: 01c 4 V supply and SERVICE_POWER_EN from the flight MCU -> 01optional-ldo -> separately controlled peripheral circuits."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 27.94 0)
